      "type": "text",
      "anchor": "paintballs",
      "text": "Paintballs are used in a $(l:items_blocks_machines/color_applicator)Color Applicator$(/l) in order to paint colorable blocks like $(l:items_blocks_machines/cables)cables$(/l), wool, terracotta, glass, and concrete. They can also be used in a $(l:items_blocks_machines/matter_cannon)Matter Cannon$(/l) to shoot little splotches of paint."
